```
# WordPress specific ignores
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Editor/IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swo

# Backup files
*~
*.bak
*.backup

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# PHP related
*.php.swp
*.php.swo

# Web assets
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.map

# WordPress core (if accidentally added)
wp-config.php
wp-content/uploads/
```